### GET request to index
GET http://localhost:7070/

### GET request to find by id
GET http://localhost:7070/api/v1/users/3/finds/2

### GET request to all finds by user id
GET http://localhost:7070/api/v1/users/1/finds

### POST request to create new find
POST http://localhost:7070/api/v1/finds
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-19",
  "photoURL": "testbillede1",
  "note": "Test at fund, der skal slettes.",
  "userId": 1,
  "categoryIds": [1, 3]
}

### PATCH request to update find
PATCH http://localhost:7070/api/v1/users/1/finds/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryIds": []
}

### DELETE request to delete find
DELETE http://localhost:7070/api/v1/users/1/finds/3

### GET request to all categories
GET http://localhost:7070/api/v1/categories

